# TouchDesigner OSC + gating

## Luzifer → TD (default `127.0.0.1:9000`)

| Address | Type | Values |
|---------|------|--------|
| `/luzifer/state` | string | `listening`, `thinking`, `speaking` |
| `/luzifer/user_text` | string | visitor transcript |
| `/luzifer/ai_text` | string | LLM reply |
| `/luzifer/play` | int | `1` after `speech.wav` is written |

## TD → Luzifer (default `127.0.0.1:9001`)

| Address | Type | Values |
|---------|------|--------|
| `/luzifer/in/say` | string | inject visitor text (LLM+TTS) |
| `/luzifer/in/speak` | string | TTS-only line |
| `/luzifer/in/reset` | int | `1` clear history |
| `/luzifer/in/interrupt` | int | `1` abort turn |
| `/luzifer/in/listen` | int | `1` unmute / `0` mute mic |

- WAV path: `runtime/output/speech.wav` (reload on `/luzifer/play`).
- Mic / VAD stream MUST stop whenever `state != "listening"` (covers `thinking` and `speaking` anti-feedback).
- Do not invent new `/luzifer/*` addresses without updating `docs/OSC_SPEC.md` and the TD network.
- Send OSC via `TouchDesignerOscClient`; receive via `TouchDesignerOscServer`. No raw socket one-offs in the pipeline.
